# ============================================================

deployguard-result.json
deployguard-cost-plan.json
deployguard-project-cost-plan.json

infracost*.json
infracost*.html

artifacts/
**/artifacts/

test-results/
**/test-results/

playwright-report/
**/playwright-report/


# ============================================================
